<title>UK: Allders year pretax 40.4 million stg.</title>
<headline>Allders year pretax 40.4 million stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to September 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		17.1		   vs 15.4</p>
<p> Final dividend(pence)  3.7		    vs n/a</p>
<p> Pretax		     40.4		   vs 23.5</p>
<p> Turnover		   360		    vs 310</p>
<p> Full company name - Allders Plc</p>
<p>Note - Retailer Allders said its final dividend of 3.7 pence, plus its 2.4 pence interim dividend and a special interim dividend of 46 pence, after the sale of Allders International dute free business makes the total for the year 52.1 pence. </p>
<p>The company said pretax profits included a 33.2 million profit on the sale of Allders International to a subsidiary of Swissair in June for 160 million stg in cash.</p>
<p>The group said the start of the current year had been very encouraging with sales ahead 36 percent in the nine weeks to November 30. Sales were 14 percent ahead on a like for like basis. --London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
